{"id":"d41420ede99a3508","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-generated-submodel.md","title":"Generated Submodel Lemma","display":"lem-generated-submodel — Generated Submodel Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-generated-submodel","aliases":["89-lem-generated-submodel"],"display":"lem-generated-submodel — Generated Submodel Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-generated-submodel]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-generated-submodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-generated-submodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-generated-submodel — Generated Submodel Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4505fdbef0375a48\" href=\"?note=4505fdbef0375a48\" title=\"89-df-generated-submodel\">89-df-generated-submodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\\)</span> is a Kripke model.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_w=(W_w,R_w,V_w)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_w=(W_w,R_w,V_w)\\)</span> is the submodel generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in W_w\">\\(u\\in W_w\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}generated\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},u\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}_w,u\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}generated\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},u\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}_w,u\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_w\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_w\\)</span> : 由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>生成的子模型 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4505fdbef0375a48\" href=\"?note=4505fdbef0375a48\" title=\"89-df-generated-submodel\">89-df-generated-submodel</a>)</li>\n<li>公式在原世界和生成子模型中真值相同</li>\n<li>模态逻辑的局部性</li>\n<li>GL框架性质的重要应用</li>\n<li>证明对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 作结构归纳；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_w\">\\(W_w\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-后继封闭，因而\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 子句在原模型与生成子模型中量化同一批后继。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-generated-submodel","status":"resolved","id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-generated-submodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-generated-submodel","status":"resolved","id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}_w$ : 由$w$生成的子模型 (see [[89-df-generated-submodel]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_w=(W_w,R_w,V_w)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in W_w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}generated\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},u\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}_w,u\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_w","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"W_w","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":1103,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["4505fdbef0375a48","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}